      <Text>Systems-first delivery improves execution consistency compared to disconnected tools and templates.</Text>
      <EvidenceRefs><Ref>E02</Ref><Ref>E03</Ref></EvidenceRefs>
      <UsageGuidance>Say "often" / "tends to" / "in many teams" (not universal).</UsageGuidance>
    </Claim>

